<title>FRANCE: French Apr unemployment down 6,400, rate 12.8 pct.</title>
<headline>French Apr unemployment down 6,400, rate 12.8 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>French unemployment fell for a third month running in April, by 6,400 or 0.2 percent, to 3,081,100, labour ministry data showed.</p>
<p>The jobless rate, based on International Labour Organisation (ILO) criteria which exclude jobseekers who did any work, was unchanged at a record 12.8 percent.</p>
</text>
